      <uighur>qas</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хас</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XAS</transcript>
      <definition>1 n. Jasper, nephrite, jade; used figuratively to qualify certain objects as particularly noble or valuable (cf. Ch. yü).</definition>
      <page>941</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠰ ᠣᠷᠳᠤ</unicode>
